[{"id":"CN-TR-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","连接"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>TCP 的“连接”应如何理解？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它是双方维护的有状态字节流传输上下文，通常由两端 IP 和端口组成的四元组标识。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>连接不是一根物理线路，也不是 HTTP 请求本身。它包含序列空间、确认、窗口、状态和计时器；同一 TCP 连接可以承载多个 HTTP 请求。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-storage-state","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["BrowserContext","登录状态"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(七)浏览器上下文.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(七)浏览器上下文","articlePath":"posts/8dafa0dc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(七)浏览器上下文.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(七)浏览器上下文","articlePath":"posts/8dafa0dc/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>业务回归套件需要复用登录时，哪种方式更合适？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>B\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>storage_state 可以复用已验证会话，同时保持每个测试独立创建 Context；状态文件必须按凭据管理并验证有效期。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["B"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>所有测试共享同一个 Page\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>为角色生成受控 storage_state，并创建独立 Context\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>把真实账号 Cookie 提交到仓库\u003c/p>\n"}]}]